  ('24112cfa-d669-4cd6-b926-0b1db930369d', 'c7d864bd-acd8-47a7-a0bb-3f010bfd8d96', '2a4ade8b-ba14-42d6-8a29-c347c752110d', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Assembly', 'Assembly identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within community structure. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After succession, assembly supplies what is needed to address food webs.', 3),
